---
---

<div class="py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center gsap-fadein">
        <h2
          class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-light-300 "
        >
          Silvacore: Preise & Verfügbarkeit
        </h2>
        <p
          class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-light-100  sm:text-5xl"
        >
          Transparente Preise für Silvacore
        </p>
      </div>
      <p
        class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg leading-8 gsap-fadein"
      >
        Silvacore bietet flexible Preispläne, die auf die Bedürfnisse von Einzelpersonen und Unternehmen zugeschnitten sind. Wählen Sie den Plan, der am besten zu Ihnen passt, und profitieren Sie von den Vorteilen einer effizienten Hausverwaltung.
      </p>
      <div
        class="isolate mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-lg grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:mx-0 md:max-w-none md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2"
      >
        <div
          class="gsap-fadein rounded-3xl p-8 xl:p-10 ring-1 ring-light-500 transition-all hover:bg-primary-900/50"
          id="free"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4">
            <h3
              id="tier-free"
              class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-light-100 "
            >
              <i class="fa-regular fa-seedling text-light-100 "></i> Free
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-light-300 ">
            Lerne die Software kennen und probiere sie aus.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-x-1">
            <!-- Price, update based on frequency toggle state -->
            <span
              class="price text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-light-100 "
            >0,00€</span
            >
            <!-- Payment frequency, update based on frequency toggle state -->
            <span
              class="frequency text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-light-300 "
            >/Monat</span
            >
          </p>
          <!--<a href='#' aria-describedby='tier-freelancer'-->
          <!--   class='mt-6 block rounded-md py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold leading-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-pancho-200/10 text-white hover:bg-pancho-200/20 focus-visible:outline-white'>Buy-->
          <!--  plan</a>-->
          <ul
            role="list"
            class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-light-300  xl:mt-10"
          >
            <li class="flex gap-x-3">
              <svg
                class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-light-100 "
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <span><strong>1</strong> WEG</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="gsap-fadein rounded-3xl p-8 xl:p-10 bg-primary-900/10 ring-2 ring-primary-800  transition-all hover:bg-primary-900/50"
          id="payperuse"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4">
            <h3
              id="tier-basic"
              class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-light-100 "
            >
              <i class="fa-regular fa-house text-light-100 "></i> Weitere WEG
            </h3>
            <p
              class="rounded-full bg-primary-900  px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-5 text-white"
            >
              Empfehlung
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-light-300 ">
            Zahle was du verbrauchst.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-x-1">
            <!-- Price, update based on frequency toggle state -->
            <span
              class="price text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-light-100 "
            >5,00€</span
            >
            <!-- Payment frequency, update based on frequency toggle state -->
            <span
              class="frequency text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-light-300 "
            >/WEG</span
            >
          </p>
          <!--<a href='#' aria-describedby='tier-startup'-->
          <!--   class='mt-6 block rounded-md py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold leading-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-primary-900 text-white shadow-xs hover:bg-primary-900 focus-visible:outline-primary-500'>Buy-->
          <!--  plan</a>-->
          <ul
            role="list"
            class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-light-300  xl:mt-10"
          >
            <li class="flex gap-x-3">
              <svg
                class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-light-100 "
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <span><strong>1</strong> weitere WEG</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>